																																																					=09
<div class=3D"large clear-both">
    			            				<strong class=3D"heading-6 font-w-bold has-no-bottom=
-margin text-uppercase">Primary Holding</strong>
	<p>
			=09
		The Sixth Amendment tolerates screening of child witnesses in child abuse=
 cases only if a court hears evidence and issues a case-specific finding of=
 the requisite necessity.		=09
	</p>
				<div class=3D"hidden" id=3D"diminished-text-2">
